							},
							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "- a balance must be reconciled;\n- it is an asset, liability, equity, income, or expense;\n- recognition happens at a different time;\n- it is depreciated or amortized;\n- tax or external reporting requires a stable distinction;\n- different posting, approval, or control rules apply."
						}
