					"uidString" : "Jo12AdUOTCevss1fM5apyQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Education, Household Supplies, and Vehicle Administration usually do not change debit and credit behavior.\n\nThey belong in the live object world around the ledger."
			},
